    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #1a1a2e;\n      --card: #16213e;\n      --accent: #e94560;\n      --text: #f1f1f1;\n      --input-bg: #0f3460;\n      --focus: #e94560;\n      --hover: #ff6b81;\n      --pressed: #b83a4e;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body {\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: var(--card);\n      padding: 30px 25px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--accent), 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 400px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 18px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    label {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n    input, select, button {\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      padding: 12px 14px;\n      border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background: var(--input-bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      width: 100%;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: border-color 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n    }\n    input:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n      border-color: var(--focus);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(233,69,96,0.5);\n    }\n    input:hover, select:hover, button:hover {\n      border-color: var(--hover);\n    }\n    button {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    button:hover {\n      background: var(--hover);\n      border-color: var(--hover);\n    }\n    button:active {\n      background: var(--pressed);\n      border-color: var(--pressed);\n      transform: scale(0.98);\n    }\n    .result-box {\n      background: var(--input-bg);\n      border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 28px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--text);\n      min-height: 60px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 400px) {\n      .card { padding: 20px 15px; gap: 14px; }\n      h1 { font-size: 20px; }\n      input, select, button { font-size: 16px; padding: 10px; }\n      .result-box { font-size: 22px; padding: 10px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n    <div>\n      <label for=\"left\">Left Number</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"left\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <label for=\"right\">Right Number</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"right\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <div class=\"result-box\" id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n  var leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\n  var rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\n  var operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\n  var calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  var resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function parseNumber(str) {\n    var trimmed = str.trim();\n    if (trimmed === '') return null;\n    var num = Number(trimmed);\n    if (!isFinite(num)) return null;\n    return num;\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    var leftVal = parseNumber(leftInput.value);\n    var rightVal = parseNumber(rightInput.value);\n    if (leftVal === null || rightVal === null) {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    var op = operationSelect.value;\n    var result;\n    switch (op) {\n      case 'add': result = leftVal + rightVal; break;\n      case 'subtract': result = leftVal - rightVal; break;\n      case 'multiply': result = leftVal * rightVal; break;\n      case 'divide':\n        if (rightVal === 0) {\n          resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n          return;\n        }\n        result = leftVal / rightVal;\n        break;\n      default:\n        resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n        return;\n    }\n    if (!isFinite(result)) {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    resultEl.textContent = String(result);\n  }\n\n  calculateBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n  [leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach(function (el) {\n    el.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n      if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        calculate();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA fully offline, dependency-free pixel-styled calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two number inputs (`left` and `right`)\n- Operation selector: Add, Subtract, Multiply, Divide\n- Calculate button\n- Result output initialized to `0`\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Rejects empty or non-finite inputs with exact text `Error`\n- Rejects division by zero with exact text `Error`\n- Outputs only the numeric result (no label)\n- Keyboard accessible: Tab navigation, Enter to calculate\n- Responsive layout down to 360px width\n- Pixel-inspired visual theme with cohesive palette\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in the **Left Number** field.\n3. Choose an operation from the dropdown.\n4. Enter a number in the **Right Number** field.\n5. Click **Calculate** or press **Enter**.\n6. The result appears in the output box.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Empty inputs → `Error`\n- Non-numeric or non-finite inputs (e.g., `Infinity`, `NaN`) → `Error`\n- Division by zero → `Error`\n- Any operation resulting in a non-finite value → `Error`\n\n## Offline & Privacy\n\nNo network requests, no storage, no external assets, no packages. Everything runs locally in your browser.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup and styles\n- `script.js` – calculator logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
